{
  "version": 2,
  "reportSize": 32,
  "note": "Conversations, each replayed through the keyboard's own state machine, kb_machine.c. steps is what happened: connect, a CONTEXT from the host (its fields as the daemon names them), a key pressed, held or released, or time passing. sent is everything that reached the host, in order: each STATE, at index report in the interaction's .bin, and each row of the tmux key table. Keystrokes for the program in the pane are not included. The keyboard starts on mac each time. Recorded with test/run.sh record.",
